    "updated_at": "2024-02-09T15:39:35Z",
    "body": "I'd like to slightly broaden this issue to cover both the `<details>` and `<summary>` elements.  In at least Chromium and WebKit the `<summary>` element also has restrictions on its display type; I've prototyped removing both sets of restrictions behind a flag, as noted above.\r\n\r\nI need to do some further investigation on whether those restrictions are supported by statements in the HTML spec... but if they are I'd like to remove such statements along with the statements restricting `<details>`.",
